WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.087 --> 00:00:08.321
The king drummed his fingers on his throne, looking at his wife.

2
00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:11.613
"How can we make Ellen cry?"

3
00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:16.008
"It's impossible." The queen sighed.

4
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:19.422
"All she does is laugh."

5
00:00:19.423 --> 00:00:24.768
But the queen soon came up with another idea.

6
00:00:24.769 --> 00:00:28.771
The next day a beggar arrived at the palace.

7
00:00:28.772 --> 00:00:31.113
His clothes were rags.

8
00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.755
His face was streaked with dirt.

9
00:00:33.756 --> 00:00:38.928
A servant led Ellen into the room.

10
00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:42.085
"Yes, Papa?" Ellen said.

11
00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:45.598
The king introduced the beggar.

12
00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:48.284
"This man has had a hard life.

13
00:00:48.285 --> 00:00:50.582
He would like to tell you some stories."

14
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.661
The king turned to the beggar.

15
00:00:52.662 --> 00:00:57.594
"Please tell us your saddest tales."

16
00:00:57.595 --> 00:01:02.647
For the next hour, the beggar told Ellen about being poor.

17
00:01:02.648 --> 00:01:07.382
"Every night I go to bed hungry.

18
00:01:07.383 --> 00:01:20.021
I sleep in the cold. Some days I eat only a few crumbs."

19
00:01:20.022 --> 00:01:23.653
Tears fell from the queen's eyes.

20
00:01:23.654 --> 00:01:27.805
"How sad." She glanced at her daughter.

21
00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:29.917
Ellen was looking down.

22
00:01:29.918 --> 00:01:36.326
A sound was bubbling up from her chest.

23
00:01:36.327 --> 00:01:38.839
The queen's face lit up.

24
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:42.740
"My idea is working," she thought.

25
00:01:42.741 --> 00:01:46.362
"The princess is sobbing!"

26
00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:50.634
But the sound bursting from Ellen was not a sob.

27
00:01:50.635 --> 00:01:56.496
It was a giggle.

28
00:01:56.497 --> 00:02:03.325
A second later the princess was screaming with laughter.

29
00:02:03.326 --> 00:02:08.132
The king and queen groaned as a servant took her away.

30
00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:15.081
"What will we do?" the king asked.

31
00:02:15.082 --> 00:02:20.047
The next day the desperate parents tried something else.

32
00:02:20.048 --> 00:02:29.572
They marched upstairs to the princess' bedroom.

33
00:02:29.573 --> 00:02:38.050
Then they yelled at her in their loudest, meanest voices.

34
00:02:38.051 --> 00:02:41.378
The princess' lip quivered. And then . . .

35
00:02:41.379 --> 00:02:48.155
She burst into laughter.

36
00:02:48.156 --> 00:02:52.897
Now, around this time, a handsome prince was looking for a wife.

37
00:02:52.898 --> 00:02:58.390
The prince was brave and kind, and many women loved him.

38
00:02:58.391 --> 00:03:04.627
Yet the prince didn't love any of them back.

39
00:03:04.628 --> 00:03:10.128
"I will travel to another kingdom," he decided at last.

40
00:03:10.129 --> 00:03:13.596
"Perhaps I can find the right princess there.

41
00:03:13.597 --> 00:03:25.162
I want a wife who makes me laugh and feel happy."

42
00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:31.145
One afternoon he was riding along a lake.

43
00:03:31.146 --> 00:03:35.420
"What a lovely lake," the prince thought.

44
00:03:35.421 --> 00:03:38.411
"Ahh!" someone shrieked.

45
00:03:38.412 --> 00:03:42.519
The prince jumped off his horse and ran to the water's edge.

46
00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:49.930
In the center of the lake, a woman was drowning!

